_token><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad></abs_vis_token>Thus, if you are standing at the shower curtain looking toward the door, the mirror would be to your left.\n</spatial_thinking>\n\n<thinking><abs_vis_token><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad></abs_vis_token>From the description above, the mirror is inferred to be located above the sink, which is on the far left side of the bathroom as seen in the first image. When standing at the shower curtain and facing the door (which is to the left of the shower curtain), the sink—and thus the mirror—would be to the left of your position. Therefore, the correct answer is A. left.\n</thinking>\n\n<answer>A</answer><|im_end|>","latent":{"blocks":4,"body_tokens":64,"events":[{"phase":"spatial_thinking","boundary":0,"kind":"section_entry","body_tokens":16},{"phase":"spatial_thinking","boundary":1,"kind":"source_step","body_tokens":16},{"phase":"spatial_thinking","boundary":2,"kind":"source_step","body_tokens":16},{"phase":"thinking","boundary":0,"kind":"section_entry","body_tokens":16}]},"prompt_sha256":"101836ed75e8819cfe6ace959a70753d55f8d9d421297268ad90d39395b6dd49","rl":null}
